    "reason": "[ev-777e46f70ea8] and [ev-e2dc5d4e7caf] show the fix is to the ksonnet library (production/ksonnet/loki/shipper.libsonnet): it failed to generate the tsdb_shipper storage config when TSDB shipper was configured without BoltDB shipper. The proposed exposure reads a Helm values key (storage.using_boltdb_shipper), but this is a jsonnet _config field, not a Helm chart value. It also leaves out the TSDB-shipper-enabled condition, so it would flag Helm environments that are not exposed. No available predicate reads ksonnet _config, so no correct asserted condition follows; applicability should be undetermined.",
